{
  "slug": "auto-log-your-claude-code-sessions-as-odoo-timesheets",
  "name": "Auto Log Your Claude Code Sessions As Odoo Timesheets",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Auto-log your Claude Code sessions as Odoo timesheets. Tracks time spent, token usage, and uses AI to match your work to existing project tasks.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **3 commands** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `odoo-timesheet` (Use this skill when the user mentions Odoo timesheets, asks about logging time, wants to configure the timesheet…)\n- **Commands** (3): `log` (Manually log current session as an Odoo timesheet entry), `setup` (Configure Odoo connection for the timesheet plugin (URL, DB, credentials, project ID)), `test` (Test the Odoo connection and show available tasks in the configured project)\n- **Hooks** (2): `UserPromptSubmit`, `Stop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install auto-log-your-claude-code-sessions-as-odoo-timesheets@claude-community` from `sadeem-cloud/claude_odoo_timesheet_plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
